3) Exact expression
By symmetry of the binomial with $$$p=\tfrac12$$$,
$$$ \mathbb{P}\big(\mathrm{Bin}(435,\tfrac12)\ge 300\big) = \sum_{k=300}^{435} \binom{435}{k} 2^{-435} = \sum_{k=0}^{135} \binom{435}{k} 2^{-435}. $$$
